1. OWASP material (docs/threat-model.md, including its "OWASP 2026 source" note)

   Source: "OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2026", Version 2026,
   OWASP GenAI Security Project, https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-genai-llm-top-10-2026/
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

   What is used: the entry IDs and names (LLM01 to LLM10), the 2025 ranks from Figure 1
   (page 6), the scope note on page 7 (one short quotation, "becomes an actor, with tools it
   can call"), and a paraphrase of the introductory letter's remark on the Misinformation
   entry. The mapping of these entries to the Larkfield scenario, conditions, attacks and
   results is this repository's own work. The OWASP Agentic Top 10 is mentioned by name only;
   no material is taken from it.

   The OWASP-derived parts of docs/threat-model.md are offered under CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes:
   entries were selected, paraphrased and mapped to this lab's scenario.

